  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)<br><strong>Mods:</strong> All Melee Weapons</p>\n<p>Once per Round at the start of your Turn you can enter Blocking Stance without an Action, if you have active Speedware, Berserk, or Timewarp's primary effect; have no REF, DEX, or MOVE penalty; and aren't Prone, grappled, or in a vehicle. Until your next Turn you hold the weapon two-handed, can't make Aimed Shots, take -2 REF, DEX, and MOVE, and have a Bulletproof Shield of 5 HP (Poor), 10 HP (Standard), or 15 HP (Excellent, or with a total Initiative bonus of +4 or more); its HP refills each time you enter the stance. If it's destroyed, you leave the stance and the weapon drops one quality tier (Poor becomes non-functional); restoring it takes 10 minutes and a DV13 Weaponstech check.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
